    "file": "File:Fungal Pathogens, Epiphytes, and Endophytes Affecting Cannabis Inflorescences.png",
    "sourceUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Fungal_Pathogens,_Epiphytes,_and_Endophytes_Affecting_Cannabis_Inflorescences.png",
